  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon, Monika! We don't have all day.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Even if</i> I can run very fast by yelling good.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521957
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Guess that's my queue!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521958
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, are you going to carry me the whole way, or what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521959
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Eh, I should probably take the chance to get a workout in.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521960
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, sure.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I was just teasing you, {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521961
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But I guess I'll take you up on that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521962
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I get Monika in a piggy-back, and start yelling our way toward the Throat
      of the World.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521963
    - rid: 4351268438874521964
